{
  "note": "Word positions are the 1-based positions in the bundled quran.sqlite. A dua is included when the words are addressed to Allah, ask Him for something or seek refuge in Him, and a believer can say them as their own; the reliance and travel groups also hold words the Quran tells the reader to say. For prayers about a people, asking for a just ruling or for help is in and asking for harm is out; see the excluded list for what was left out.",
  "groups": [
    {
